---
import Base from "../../../../layouts/Base.astro";
import LegalDraft from "../../../../components/LegalDraft.astro";
import { REPO } from "../../../../lib/site";
---
<Base title="Contact | doorbell.life" description="Email contact@doorbell.life or open a GitHub issue." noindex>
  <main>
    <h1>How do I contact doorbell.life?</h1>
    <LegalDraft en />
    <ul>
      <li><strong>General questions, removal requests, partnerships</strong>: contact@doorbell.life</li>
      <li><strong>Data errors, translations, region packs</strong>: <a href={`${REPO}/issues`}>GitHub issues</a> (public; please don't include personal information)</li>
      <li><strong>Security issues</strong>: see <a href="/legal/usa/security/">Reporting a security issue</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>If you are the person in a missing-person case, or family, and want it removed, put "Removal request" in the subject and we will handle it first.</p>
  </main>
</Base>
